{"id":8867219505351,"title":"Sports Theme Softball Bedding – Premium Teal Yellow Comforter Set for","handle":"sports-theme-softball-bedding-premium-teal-yellow-comforter-set-for","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your bedroom into a celebration of your favorite sport with this premium Softball Comforter Set from Jeminise. Designed for ultimate comfort and style, this bedding set is perfect for softball players, fans, and lovers alike, offering a cozy and decorative touch to any room.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeaningful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e Show your support for softball with a bedding set that celebrates the spirit of the game and its dedicated fans.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted from 100% brushed microfiber polyester (360 gsm), offering an ultra-soft, smooth, durable, and fade-resistant feel that's also cool and breathable.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in Twin (68\"x90\"), Full (79\"x90\"), Queen (90x90\"), and King (104\"x90\") to fit a variety of beds.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Each set includes one high-quality comforter, perfect for a complete bedding refresh.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designed for convenience, this comforter set is machine washable and dries quickly; tumble dry low (use a mesh laundry bag for best results).\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSuperior Manufacturing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features environmental protection finishing techniques to prevent fading and smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting enjoyment.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProduct Style:\u003c\/strong\u003e Showcases a vibrant Softball Design 05 with a sport theme, adding a dynamic and relaxin